# A turn in Fast mode when the catalog that would say the model offers Fast
# cannot be read: fx says so above the answer and goes at standard speed
# (`orchestrator.zig:7253-7262`).
models models-broken.json
gateway speed-standard-turns.json
seed fast-seed-opus-on.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
snap start
type say something
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap turn
gwlog
